#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:2
msgid "Instance Details"
msgstr "Detalles de la instancia"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The instance detail page is where you can view and fully manage an "
"instance. To get to an instance detail page, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Provisioning --> Instances`, and click on an Instance. "
"Please note Instance details and actions will differ between Instance "
"types and user permissions."
msgstr ""
"El/La instancia detalle página es donde you puede ver y fully administrar"
" un instancia. A obtener a un instancia detalle página, navegue un "
"|ProIns|, y haga clic en un Instancia. Tenga en cuenta Instancia detalles"
" y acciones será differ entre Instancia tipos y usuario permisos."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:6
msgid ""
"There are several sections within an Instance page that provide useful "
"capabilities to the user."
msgstr ""
"There are several sections within an Instancia page that provide useful "
"capabilities to the user."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:8
#, fuzzy
msgid ".. image:: /images/provisioning/instances/instanceDetail.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/provisioning/instances/instanceDetail.png"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:10
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Resumen"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:11
msgid "Basic information, stats and status information"
msgstr "Basic información, stats and status información"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Availability:** The Instance availability is the percentage of time the"
" Instance is up. When stopping Instances, the option is given to mute "
"monitoring if you wish for intentional down time not to count against the"
" availability"
msgstr ""
"**Availability:** El/La Instancia availability es el/la percentage de "
"time el/la Instancia es up. Cuando stopping Instancias, el/la opción es "
"given a mute monitoring si you wish para intentional down time no a count"
" against el/la availability"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Response Time:** If listed as \"N/A\" (Not Applicable), the Instance "
"does not have any Checks set against it or does not have any Checks set "
"against it that report a response time. Agent Checks, for example, do not"
" report a response time. Some Checks, such as Docker Checks for Docker "
"containers, require |morpheus| to ping the container which reports a "
"response time."
msgstr ""
"**Response Time:** Si listed as \"N/Un\" (No Applicable), el/la Instancia"
" hace no tienen cualquier Checks establecer against it o hace no tienen "
"cualquier Checks establecer against it que report un response time. Agent"
" Checks, por ejemplo, hacer no report un response time. Some Checks, como"
" Docker Checks para Docker containers, requerir |morpheus| a ping el/la "
"container cual reports un response time."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:15
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "Desplegar"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:16
msgid ""
"Track deployment history for instance types that support deployments or "
"manually kick off a deployment (only visible for Instance Types that "
"support deployments)"
msgstr ""
"Track despliegue history para instancia tipos que soportar despliegues o "
"manually kick off un despliegue (solo visible para Instancia Tipos que "
"soportar despliegues)"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:17
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Configuración"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:18
msgid ""
"Some Instance Types support custom configuration settings (for example, "
"MySQL presents the my.ini)"
msgstr ""
"Some Instancia Types support custom configuración configuración (por "
"ejemplo, MySQL presents the my.ini)"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:19
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "Resources"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:20
msgid ""
"VMs, containers, or other resources associated with the Instance are "
"listed here. Some Instance Types, such as XaaS Instances, will not have "
"resources and the tab is not displayed"
msgstr ""
"VMs, containers, o otro recursos associated con el/la Instancia son "
"listed here. Some Instancia Tipos, como XaaS Instancias, será no tienen "
"recursos y el/la pestaña es no displayed"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:21
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "Tiempo de ejecución"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:22
msgid ""
"View the environment variables presented to the Instances or exported to "
"the Instances via Apps (more on this in the Apps section). Users may also"
" see Imported environment variables that may be referenced by the running"
" Instance."
msgstr ""
"Ver el/la entorno variables presented a el/la Instancias o exportado a "
"el/la Instancias via Apps (más en este en el/la Apps sección). Usuarios "
"puede also ver Imported entorno variables que puede be referenced por "
"el/la running Instancia."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:24
msgid ""
"For Instances that support load balancing and auto scaling, configure "
"auto scaling thresholds and load balancer settings in the Scale "
"subsection that pertain to a particular Instance."
msgstr ""
"Para Instancias que soportar cargar balancing y auto scaling, configurar "
"auto scaling thresholds y cargar balancer configuración en el/la Scale "
"subsection que pertain a un particular Instancia."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:26
msgid ""
"The software subsection will show any tracked software which is Installed"
" as part of the provisioning process and is being tracked."
msgstr ""
"El/La software subsection será mostrar cualquier tracked software cual es"
" Installed as part de el/la aprovisionamiento proceso y es being tracked."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:27
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Storage"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:28
msgid ""
"See storage information associated with the Instance including the list "
"of volumes and controllers which are associated with each machine that "
"makes up the Instance."
msgstr ""
"Ver storage información associated con el/la Instancia including el/la "
"lista de volumes y controllers cual son associated con cada machine que "
"makes up el/la Instancia."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:29
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Red"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:30
msgid ""
"Useful for configuring network interfaces for your VMs or security groups"
" which allow access to the Instance."
msgstr ""
"Useful para configuring network interfaces para your VMs o security "
"groups cual permitir acceso a el/la Instancia."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:31
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "Monitoreo"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:32
msgid ""
"Quick summary of the monitoring system and all checks that were "
"configured to test the state of the Instance. Stats views (memory, cpu, "
"etc.) can be zoomed out to a 90-day view if desired (in global settings, "
"ensure your stats retention setting will support this). Logs and guidance"
" for the individual Instance are also shown in their respective subtabs."
msgstr ""
"Quick summary de el/la monitoring system y todos checks que fueron "
"configurado a test el/la state de el/la Instancia. Stats views (memory, "
"cpu, etc.) puede ser zoomed out a un 90-day ver si desired (en global "
"configuración, ensure your stats retention setting será soportar este). "
"Logs y guidance para el/la individual Instancia son also shown en their "
"respective subtabs."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:33
msgid "Backups"
msgstr "Backups"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:34
msgid ""
"Quick backup dashboard. Useful for viewing historical backups and "
"snapshots as well as adding new backup jobs. For layouts that support "
"snapshots, users with **Snapshots: Full** permission can start one from "
":guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Create Snapshot`; see "
":doc:`managing_instances`."
msgstr "Panel de control rápido de backups. Útil para ver backups y snapshots históricos, así como para agregar nuevos trabajos de backup. Para layouts que admiten snapshots, los usuarios con permiso **Snapshots: Full** pueden iniciar uno desde :guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Create Snapshot`; consulte :doc:`managing_instances`."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:35
msgid "History"
msgstr "Historial"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:36
msgid ""
"See historical information related to automation which has been run "
"against the Instance. This is useful for examining automation which was "
"run as part of a phase of a Provisioning Workflow. Users can also drill "
"into the Workflows to examine individual Tasks, including viewing the "
"output from these Tasks to confirm success or troubleshoot issues."
msgstr ""
"Ver historical información related a automation cual ha sido ejecutar "
"against el/la Instancia. Este es useful para examining automation cual "
"fue ejecutar as part de un phase de un Aprovisionamiento Flujo de "
"trabajo. Usuarios puede also drill en el/la Flujos de trabajo a examine "
"individual Tareas, including viewing el/la output desde estos Tareas a "
"confirm success o troubleshoot issues."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:37
msgid "Costing"
msgstr "Costing"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:38
msgid ""
"Invoices pertaining to the Instance are displayed here. See the Instance "
"level or host level invoices along with individual line items. In the "
"History subtab view historical pricing data to monitor trends. In the "
"Prices subtab view any prices which have been created and used to build a"
" metered costing profile for the workload."
msgstr ""
"Invoices pertaining a el/la Instancia son displayed here. Ver el/la "
"Instancia level o host level invoices along con individual line "
"elementos. En el/la History subtab ver historical pricing data a monitor "
"trends. En el/la Prices subtab ver cualquier prices cual han sido creado "
"y used a build un metered costing profile para el/la workload."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:39
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Consola"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:40
msgid ""
"Access the Instance or container via a client-less Console supporting "
"SSH, RDP, VNC, or even hypervisor-level remote consoles."
msgstr ""
"Access the Instancia or container via a client-less Console supporting "
"SSH, RDP, VNC, or even hypervisor-level remote consoles."

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:41
msgid "Wiki"
msgstr "Wiki"

#: ../../provisioning/instances/instance_details.rst:42
msgid ""
"View the Wiki page for this Instance or edit the existing Wiki page "
"(which may currently be blank). The content field supports markdown "
"formatting, see the main Wiki section of |morpheus| documentation for "
"additional details."
msgstr ""
"Ver el/la Wiki página para este Instancia o editar el/la existente Wiki "
"página (cual puede actualmente be blank). El/La content campo soporta "
"markdown formatting, ver el/la main Wiki sección de |morpheus| "
"documentación para adicional detalles."

